{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4ENS4jp4GWPRaGo3v7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, featureless.*\n\n*You hold up the key.*\n\n*Nothing happens.*\n\n*The door does not recognize \"key.\" A key must have a name, a shape, a purpose. It must be cut for a specific lock. It must carry weight — the weight of a secret, a memory, a truth.*\n\n*The door waits.*\n\n*What key do you hold?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":97,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}